# 9. Amazon EC2

Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (EC2) provides virtual servers.

Instead of buying physical machines:

```
Physical Server

↓

EC2 Instance
```

---

# 10. EC2 Architecture

```
EC2 Instance

├── AMI
├── Instance Type
├── Storage
├── Security Group
└── Network Interface
```

